 "content": "engenn4le10ob05aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "floating"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "moving on the surface of a liquid "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The houseboat was floating in the canal. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le10ob05aud05"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le10ob05re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Think about what you can do on the weekend. Write 5 sentences about your ideas or intentions. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write sentences about your ideas or intentions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your sentences to a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Listen to your partner's intentions."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write about social plans."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I express intention."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I communicate my plans to my partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I listen to my partner's plans."}]}], "type": "sena"}